    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n50943" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">villōsus</span></b> , a, um, adj.
		villus, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>hairy</i>, <i>shaggy</i>, <i>rough</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">leo,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 8, 177</span></i>
			: pectora (Caci) saetis,
				<i><span class="en">id. ib. 8, 266</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">guttura (Cerberi) colubris,</span>”
				i. e. <i>with vipers in place of hair</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. M.
					10, 21</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">radix,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					12, 12, 26, § 45</span></i>
			.—<i>Comp.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">arbor,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					16, 10, 19, § 46</span></i>
			. —<i>Sup.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">animal,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					11, 39, 94, § 229</span></i>
			.</div>
